.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-SERVICES 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-services
.Nd list, install, and control admin-managed services
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad services
.Op Cm list | install Ar NAME | affect Ar ACTION Ar NAME
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad services
works with the optional services the admin service can spawn on demand,
such as Kiwix, Kolibri, CyberChef, and Flatnotes.
.Pp
With no subcommand,
.Cm list
runs and prints each service's name, whether it is installed, its
installation status, and its container image.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm list
Print the known services and their status.
This is the default when no subcommand is given.
.It Cm install Ar NAME
Ask the admin service to install the service named
.Ar NAME .
.It Cm affect Ar ACTION Ar NAME
Apply
.Ar ACTION
.Pq Cm start , Cm stop , or Cm restart
to the service named
.Ar NAME .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad services
List the available services and their status.
.It Ic nomad services install kiwix
Install the Kiwix service.
.It Ic nomad services affect restart kiwix
Restart the Kiwix service.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-stl 1 ,
.Xr nomad-upgrade 1
